{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120662","id":3941438696,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7q7ZTo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120662","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120662.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120662.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120662","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120662/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120662/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120662/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/adfab2fbfe21e0335e6f46cb452f222de6dc8825","number":120662,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add ZXC compression codec","user":{"login":"hellobertrand","id":5901952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDE5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5901952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand","html_url":"https://github.com/hellobertrand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hellobertrand/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15084\r\n\r\nAdds [ZXC](https://github.com/hellobertrand/zxc) as a new optional compression format, alongside FastLZ, Deflate, Zstandard, gzip and Brotli. ZXC is an asymmetric LZ codec (BSD-3-Clause), optimized for **very fast decompression**. That fits the engine's \"compress once, decompress many times at load\" pattern. Full rationale is in the proposal.\r\n\r\n> Disclosure: I'm the author/maintainer of the ZXC library.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- `Compression::MODE_ZXC` with full `compress` / `decompress` / `get_max_compressed_buffer_size`.\r\n- Exposed to scripting as `FileAccess.COMPRESSION_ZXC`, works from `PackedByteArray.compress()` / `decompress()` and `FileAccess.open_compressed()`.\r\n- Project setting `compression/formats/zxc/compression_level` (range 1-6, default 3).\r\n- Build options `zxc` and `builtin_zxc`, gated by the `ZXC_ENABLED` define.` zxc=no` builds cleanly.\r\n- ZXC's runtime SIMD dispatch wired into SCons: `zxc_compress`.c / `zxc_decompress.c` / `zxc_huffman.c` are compiled once per ISA variant (`sse2/avx2/avx512` on x86_64, `neon` on ARM) and selected at runtime via `CPUID/getauxval`. No `-march=native`, single portable binary.\r\n- Library bundled under `thirdparty/zxc/` (v0.12.0), documented in `thirdparty/README.md` and `COPYRIGHT.txt` (BSD-3-Clause, plus vendored `rapidhash` under Expat/MIT).\r\n- Class reference updates (`FileAccess.xml`, `ProjectSettings.xml`) and round-trip unit tests.\r\n\r\n### Benchmark\r\n\r\nStandalone harness mirroring the exact Compression calls (zstd level 3, fastlz, zxc). Apple M3, clang -O3, single-threaded, zstd 1.5.7, zxc 0.12.0 (NEON path selected at runtime). Throughput in MB/s (decimal). Every row round-trips.\r\n\r\n**Structured text  `doc/classes/*.xml` (8.3 MB)**\r\n\r\n| codec | ratio | comp MB/s | decomp MB/s |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| zstd-3 (engine default) | **6.24x** | 251 | 948 |\r\n| fastlz | 3.75x | **256** | 414 |\r\n| zxc-1 | 2.82x | 237 | **3139** |\r\n| **zxc-3 (default)** | 4.23x | 89 | **1764** |\r\n| zxc-6 | 5.48x | 3.9 | 1814 |\r\n\r\n**Low-compressibility binary, editor-binary slice (25 MB)**\r\n\r\n| codec | ratio | comp MB/s | decomp MB/s |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| zstd-3 | **3.05x** | 142 | 431 |\r\n| fastlz | 1.89x | 121 | 262 |\r\n| zxc-1 | 1.45x | **316** | **4936** |\r\n| **zxc-3** | 2.11x | 55 | 2398 |\r\n| zxc-6 | 2.36x | 5.8 | 2549 |\r\n\r\nThe win is decode speed: zxc-3 is 2x faster than zstd-3 and 4x faster than fastlz. It's a strong **FastLZ replacement**: better ratio and decode speed. It does not beat Zstandard on ratio or compression speed. Useful range is L1-L5.\r\n\r\n**Real-world load (Godot engine path)**\r\n\r\nLoading a serialized `PackedScene` (16k-node level, 1.71 MB) through the engine, optimized editor build (`dev_build=no optimize=speed`), Apple M3:\r\n\r\n| codec | comp. size | ratio | in-memory decode | engine load (`open_compressed`) |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| fastlz | 740 KB | 2.31x | 1.183 ms | 1.430 ms |\r\n| zstd-3 | **261 KB** | **6.55x** | 0.794 ms | 1.073 ms |\r\n| **zxc-3** | 574 KB | 2.98x | **0.167 ms** | **0.485 ms** |\r\n\r\nZXC decodes the scene 4.7x faster than zstd-3 in pure decode, 2.2x faster through the full FileAccessCompressed path. The trade-off: zstd's output is 2.2x smaller. So on slow / cold storage where I/O dominates, the smaller file narrows the gap. ZXC's advantage is largest when data is cached or storage is fast.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":27909